    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Earnest Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 15 Deerpark Lodge to the market. This well-presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment is sure to appeal to both owner-occupiers and investors alike, with the added benefit of the property being eligible to achieve market rent.\r\n\r\nThe property boasts a host of attractive features including a spacious east-facing balcony, communal parking, laminate flooring throughout, and a bright, cosy open-plan living and kitchen area.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an L-shaped entrance hallway with a convenient storage room and separate hot press. To the left is the open-plan living room and kitchen, with double doors opening onto the generous east-facing balcony, providing an ideal space to relax or entertain. The well-appointed kitchen features white floor and wall-mounted units, a tiled splashback, a window providing natural light, and space for a freestanding fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nThere are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, with the second bedroom being the larger of the two. The bathroom is partially tiled and comprises a bath, WC, WHB, and a window providing natural ventilation.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in the established and popular Kiltipper area at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains, the property enjoys a superb range of amenities close by, including The Square Shopping Centre, Eurospar, schools, childcare, Tallaght University Hospital, Tallaght Stadium and Thomas Davis GAA Club. Excellent transport links include numerous Dublin Bus routes, the Red Line LUAS at The Square, and easy access to the M50, M7 and N81, with Dublin City Centre approximately 25 minutes away. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended. Contact Earnest Estate Agents by phone or email to arrange an appointment"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
